mode: "100644"
header: "---\nname: daily-cashflow-forecast\ndescription: \"Build and maintain a rolling 13-week direct cash-flow forecast with a hard liquidity floor alert. Use when the operator asks for cash runway detail, when accounts-manager publishes new AR/AP aging schedules, when payroll or debt-service dates change, or when a payment-gateway payout lag is about to move more than the floor amount. Produces the one artifact every finance role reads before approving spend.\"\nrisk: safe\nsource: agyos-blueprint\ndate_added: '2026-11-19'\nprompt-source: prompt.toon\n---\n"
